{"pageProps":{"data":{"news_id":"901","news_catgory":"0","hot_news":"0","news_push":"","news_on_top":"1","news_title":"2020年上半風力太陽能發電占全球10% 創新高","news_summary":"","image_path":"","news_content":"<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">最新更新：2020/08/13 &nbsp;14:42</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"http://www.stspcsr.com.tw/user_files/news_files/2020%E9%A2%A8%E9%9B%BB.jpg\\\" style=\\\"border: 0px; border-image: none; width: 80%; vertical-align: middle; box-sizing: border-box;\\\" /></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">根據13日發表的分析報告，風力發電與太陽能板在2020年上半年創下全球電力10%的新高紀錄。（圖取自Pixabay圖庫）</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; display: block; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">（中央社倫敦13日綜合外電報導）根據今天發表的分析報告，風力發電與太陽能板在2020年上半年創下全球電力10%的新高紀錄，即使燃煤發電量下降，但要達2015年巴黎氣候協定的目標尚需更嚴苛的變革。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; display: block; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">路透社報導，科學家表示，未來10年因發電造成的溫室氣體需大幅減排，以抑制全球暖化與遏阻氣候變遷造成的最嚴重衝擊，像是洪害、乾旱與物種消逝等。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; display: block; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">根據氣候研究獨立機構Ember提出的報告，與2019年同期相比，2020上半年來自風力和太陽能發電量增加14%，燃煤發電則下降8.3%。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; display: block; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">報告說，由於疫情實施封鎖措施，這6個月期間的總電力需求下降3%。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; display: block; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">儘管燃煤發電量下降，燃煤發電廠仍在這段期間生產出全球供電量的33%。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; display: block; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">Ember資深分析師瓊斯（Dave Jones）伴隨報告發表的聲明說：「為讓氣候變遷造成的溫度改變限制在攝氏1.5度內，未來10年燃煤發電量必須每年下降13%。」</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; display: block; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">報告說，在今年上半年，歐洲和英國在風力和太陽能的發電量最大，分別是21%和33%，中國為10%，美國為12%。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; display: block; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">根據報告，燃煤發電在美國和歐洲分別下降31%與32%，然而中國僅下降2%。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; display: block; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 18px;\\\">Ember這份報告分析48國數據，這些國家占全球電力生產的83%。（譯者：陳怡君/核稿：徐睿承）1090813</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; text-align: justify; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; display: block; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 30px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-transform: none; text-indent: 0px; letter-spacing: normal; font-family: 微軟正黑體,&quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; word-spacing: 0px; display: block; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; orphans: 2; widows: 2; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\">資料來源：https://www.cna.com.tw/news/firstnews/202008130144.aspx</span></p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-08-14","clk_count":"128"}},"__N_SSG":true}